 ife. His comedy has connected with audiences through his viral clips and un
 forgettable characters\, including fan favorites Grandma Paula\, Hood Dora\
 , and his popular Besties reels\, just to name a few. His authentic storyte
 lling\, quick wit\, and larger-than-life personalities have helped take his
  comedy from social media to the live stage.\n\nJose has been featured on N
 etflix and SiriusXM’s It Was A Joke Radio and most recently served as a h
 ost for the 2026 San Diego Pride Festival. Whether audiences first discover
 ed him through one of his viral characters or are seeing him live for the f
 irst time\, Jose brings the same high-energy\, unapologetically funny style
